        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-409, Starfish Cabinet Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nYou don't have to live on the beach to love the Starfish Cabinet Pull--we aren't and we think it's great. We love the braiding on the pull that brings to mind nautical rigging. The Starfish Cabinet Hardware is a fun pull for those who love the beach. No matter what draws you to this cabinet pull, we are sure it will shine in your kitchen, your bathroom, or just about anywhere you can think to put it. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/starfish-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-209\"><b>CK-209 Starfish Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-409 3\" Star Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/norton-closer-arms.jpg?v=1704354564\" width=\"599\" height=\"123\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
